@startuml Remove Members in Class by Admin
actor Admin
participant ": ClassDetailPage " as ClassDetailPage
participant ": DeleteConfirmModal " as DeleteConfirmModal
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": ClassGroupController " as ClassGroupController
participant ": ClassGroupService " as ClassGroupService
participant ": ClassGroupRepository " as ClassGroupRepository
database Database

Admin->ClassDetailPage: 1. Admin clicks to Remove Student
    activate Admin
    activate ClassDetailPage

ClassDetailPage->DeleteConfirmModal: 2. Open Delete Confirmation Modal
    activate DeleteConfirmModal
    deactivate ClassDetailPage

Admin->DeleteConfirmModal: 3. Confirm Delete

DeleteConfirmModal->Router: 4. Send DELETE /api/classgroup/{id}/students/{studentId}
    deactivate DeleteConfirmModal
    activate Router

Router->ClassGroupController: 5. Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate ClassGroupController

ClassGroupController->ClassGroupService: 6. RemoveStudentFromClassAsync(classGroupId, studentId)
    deactivate ClassGroupController
    activate ClassGroupService

ClassGroupService->ClassGroupRepository: 7. RemoveStudentFromClassAsync(classGroupId, studentId)
    activate ClassGroupRepository

ClassGroupRepository->Database: 8. Query ClassGroupMember by ClassGroupId and UserId
    activate Database

Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 9. Return ClassGroupMember or null
    deactivate Database

ClassGroupRepository->ClassGroupRepository: 10. Validate Member exists

ClassGroupRepository->Database: 11. UPDATE ClassGroupMember SET IsDeleted = true
    activate Database

Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 12. Student Removed Successfully
    deactivate Database

ClassGroupRepository-->ClassGroupService: 13. Return true
    deactivate ClassGroupRepository

ClassGroupService-->ClassGroupController: 14. Return Success
    deactivate ClassGroupService
    activate ClassGroupController

ClassGroupController-->Router: 15. Send Success Response
    activate Router
    deactivate ClassGroupController

Router-->ClassDetailPage: 16. Student Removed Successfully
    activate ClassDetailPage
    deactivate Router

ClassDetailPage->ClassDetailPage: 17. Show Success Message

ClassDetailPage-->Admin: 18. Show Updated Students List
    deactivate ClassDetailPage
    deactivate Admin
@enduml





